1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:01,337
AI stocks fell hard.

2
00:00:01,337 --> 00:00:04,743
But another view of the same market finished green.

3
00:00:04,743 --> 00:00:06,183
How can both be true?

4
00:00:06,373 --> 00:00:12,273
For October 19–23, SPY fell 0.43%.

5
00:00:12,273 --> 00:00:17,073
The equal weight fund, RSP, gained 1.14%,

6
00:00:17,073 --> 00:00:20,373
and small caps gained 1.96%.

7
00:00:20,373 --> 00:00:23,813
Bigger companies have more influence on the main index.

8
00:00:23,813 --> 00:00:25,766
Equal weighting gives a different picture.

9
00:00:25,957 --> 00:00:32,557
CoreWeave lost 11.65%, but Palantir gained 5.76%.

10
00:00:32,557 --> 00:00:35,697
Eight of eleven major sector funds finished higher.

11
00:00:35,697 --> 00:00:38,669
That shows uneven leadership, not a guarantee

12
00:00:38,669 --> 00:00:40,100
that the selloff is over.

